  "bodyHash": "432ab5515dcb125b",
  "content": "The input text is already in Traditional Chinese (zh-TW). Therefore, no translation is needed. The original HTML is returned as is.\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/create-delight-remake\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/title.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/releases/latest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake?label=ReleaseVer&color=2CB3A8\" alt=\"release-version\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/graphs/contributors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/contributors/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"Contributors\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/network/members\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/forks/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"Forks\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/stargazers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"Stargazers\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"Issues\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpd.qq.com%252fs%252fdqw9s142x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/QQChannel-pd06113710-12B7F3?style=flat-square\" alt=\"Community1\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/readmeupdate/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/JasdewStarfield/Path-of-Truth.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"MIT License\"></a></p>\n<div>[**中文**](#中文) | [**English**](#english)</div>\n<hr>\n<h1>中文</h1>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>整合包仍在<strong>加急開發中</strong>！如果你遇到任何問題，請為我們<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fxr5r5e86lk.feishu.cn%252fshare%252fbase%252fform%252fshrcnIDUxvX4oOvWSQaddJUht9b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">反饋問題</a>！感激不盡！</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>歡迎來到齒輪盛宴的世界。</p>\n<p>本整合包由超級工程師SSWTLZZ69和超級大廚JasonQ以及自動化大神AzureCrab聯合開發</p>\n<p>在這裡你將體驗到搭建產線的樂趣</p>\n<p>也能體驗到沉浸式做菜的歡樂</p>\n<p>更能體驗到豐富的世界之旅，怪物多樣、美景層出不窮，美不勝收</p>\n<p>願齒輪盛宴能給你帶來盛宴一般的感受</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>目錄</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>機械動力：齒輪盛宴<ul>\n<li>目錄</li>\n<li>介紹</li>\n<li>核心模組<ul>\n<li>科技</li>\n<li>農業</li>\n<li>戰鬥</li></ul></li>\n<li>詳盡指引</li>\n<li>深度魔改</li>\n<li>上手指南</li>\n<li>配置要求</li>\n<li>安裝步驟</li>\n<li>未來計劃</li>\n<li>社區支持</li>\n<li><a href=\"#qq\" rel=\"nofollow\">QQ</a></li>\n<li>支持我們</li>\n<li>開發團隊</li>\n<li>特別鳴謝</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>介紹</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/introduction.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n<p>這款以 <strong><em>機械動力</em></strong> 為核心的大型深度魔改整合包，在 Minecraft Forge 1.20.1 版本上運行！</p>\n<p>魔改了<strong>超 5000+配方</strong></p>\n<p>機械動力：齒輪盛宴 將各種 <strong><em>機械動力</em></strong>、<strong><em>農夫樂事</em></strong>、<strong><em>Ad_Astra</em></strong>、<strong><em>Alex洞穴</em></strong>深度融合，創造出一個值得探索與建造的奇妙世界！</p>\n<h3>核心模組</h3>\n<h4>科技</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">機械動力</a>及其附屬</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">應用能源2</a>及其附屬</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>農業</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫樂事</a>及其附屬</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecliptic-seasons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">節氣</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quality-food\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quality Food</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/youkais-homecoming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">妖怪們的歸家</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">那不勒斯風味</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>戰鬥</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improved-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">怪物增強</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tetra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tetra</a>及其附屬</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>詳盡指引</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/ftbquests_0.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/ftbquests_1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/ftbquests_2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/ftbquests_3.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n<h3>深度魔改</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/specificites.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>全新定製配方</strong> - 專為農夫樂事模組設計！</li>\n<li><strong>多維世界探索</strong> - 各種奇異、美麗甚至怪誕的維度等待發現</li>\n<li><strong>自製物品系統</strong> - 包含數十種<strong>精美紋理</strong>的自定義物品</li>\n<li><strong>近乎完整的機械動力生態</strong> - 包含全套擴展模組</li>\n<li><strong>驚豔的世界生成</strong> - 令人驚嘆的地形與結構</li>\n<li><strong>村莊與建築革新</strong> - 全面改造的村莊、建築和傳送門</li>\n<li><strong>內建光影與資源包</strong> - 開箱即用的視覺增強</li>\n<li><strong>500+詳細任務</strong> - 手把手引導遊戲進程</li>\n<li><strong>150+高質量模組</strong> - 精心挑選的遊戲擴展</li>\n</ol>\n<p>熟悉機械動力相關模組的玩家可以快速上手，但請注意，這是一個<strong>深度魔改</strong>的整合包（使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">KubeJS</a>），不僅更改了<strong>5000+</strong>配方，還添加了巨量的<strong>原創</strong>材料，已有的機制也進行了<strong>大幅魔改</strong>。你熟悉的玩法可能需要重新適應。不要依賴慣性思維，迎接新的挑戰吧！</p>\n<h2>上手指南</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/recommendation.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n<h3>配置要求</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>最低記憶體：</strong><em>5G</em>****</li>\n<li><strong>推薦記憶體：</strong><em>6G-8G</em>****<br>\n本模組包經過深度優化，確保持續流暢的遊戲體驗，並將不斷進行性能改進。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>安裝步驟</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>測試版安裝：<ul>\n<li>下載本整合包的Release版zip文件（在Github上直接下載，亦可加群或者使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpan.quark.cn%252fs%252f5100fa468f4b%2523%252flist%252fshare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">網盤鏈接</a>獲取）。</li>\n<li>使用支持Curseforge整合包格式的啟動器（例如HMCL）安裝該文件。</li>\n<li><strong>啟動遊戲</strong></li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>未來計劃</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/future_prospects.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>持續修復漏洞</li>\n<li>增加更多華麗/強力的tetra武器</li>\n<li>加入更多可探險內容及BOSS挑戰</li>\n<li>實現更真實的食物製作流程</li>\n<li>構建平衡的經濟系統</li>\n<li>設計自動化量產挑戰任務</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>社區支持</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqm.qq.com%252fq%252fajPFnOx65a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/qq.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>參與中文社區討論！</li>\n<li>隨時向我們反饋意見！</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>支持我們</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.com%252fa%252fhk11238981\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/donation.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></a></p>\n<p>您的支持是項目持續發展的動力！無論金額大小，每筆捐贈都將幫助我們：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>保持項目持續運行</li>\n<li>不斷提升模組包質量</li>\n<li>開發更多精彩內容<br>\n感謝您的慷慨貢獻！</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>開發團隊</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/coworker.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Contributor\"></p>\n<p><strong>特別鳴謝參與本項目的所有成員（排名不分先後）</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/graphs/contributors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://contrib.rocks/image?repo=Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>其餘成員</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成員</th>\n<th>貢獻</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>ikoi03</td>\n<td><strong><em>美工</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Maruyama_Ayaa</td>\n<td><strong><em>任務書編寫</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>XinJinIris</td>\n<td><strong><em>任務書編寫</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>史萊姆li</td>\n<td><strong><em>提供管道開口與批量裝殼代碼</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Qi-Month</td>\n<td><strong><em>提供開發者模式代碼</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>以及更多其他幫助我們的同學！</td>\n<td>……</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2>特別鳴謝</h2>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><em>每一位從大一已步入職場的團隊成員在繁忙學業與工作中抽出時間參與其中，感謝你們的付出！</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<div>[回到頂部](#中文--english)</div>\n<hr>\n<h1>English</h1>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>This modpack is still under <strong>urgent development</strong>! If you encounter any issues, please <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fxr5r5e86lk.feishu.cn%252fshare%252fbase%252fform%252fshrcnIDUxvX4oOvWSQaddJUht9b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">report them to us</a>! We would be very grateful!</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Welcome to the world of Create: Delight Remake.</p>\n<p>This modpack is jointly developed by the super engineer SSWTLZZ69, the super chef JasonQ, and the automation expert AzureCrab.</p>\n<p>Here, you will experience the joy of building production lines.</p>\n<p>You will also enjoy immersive cooking gameplay.</p>\n<p>At the same time, you will embark on a rich journey across the world, with diverse monsters, stunning scenery, and countless beautiful sights.</p>\n<p>May Create: Delight Remake bring you a feast-like experience.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Table of Contents</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Create: Delight Remake<ul>\n<li>Table of Contents</li>\n<li>Introduction</li>\n<li>Core Mods<ul>\n<li>Technology</li>\n<li>Agriculture</li>\n<li>Combat</li></ul></li>\n<li>Detailed Guidance</li>\n<li>Deep Customization</li>\n<li>Getting Started</li>\n<li>System Requirements</li>\n<li>Installation</li>\n<li>Future Plans</li>\n<li>Community Support</li>\n<li><a href=\"#qq\" rel=\"nofollow\">QQ</a></li>\n<li>Support Us</li>\n<li>Development Team</li>\n<li>Special Thanks</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Introduction</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/introduction.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n<p>This is a large, deeply customized modpack centered around <strong><em>Create</em></strong>, running on Minecraft Forge 1.20.1!</p>\n<p>It features <strong>over 5000+ customized recipes</strong>.</p>\n<p>Create: Delight Remake deeply integrates <strong><em>Create</em></strong>, <strong><em>Farmer's Delight</em></strong>, <strong><em>Ad_Astra</em></strong>, and <strong><em>Alex's Caves</em></strong>, creating a wonderful world worth exploring and building in!</p>\n<h3>Core Mods</h3>\n<h4>Technology</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> and its add-ons</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2</a> and its add-ons</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Agriculture</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> and its add-ons</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecliptic-seasons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecliptic Seasons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quality-food\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quality Food</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/youkais-homecoming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Youkai's Homecoming</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Combat</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improved-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Improved Mobs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tetra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tetra</a> and its add-ons</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Detailed Guidance</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/ftbquests_0.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/ftbquests_1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/ftbquests_2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/ftbquests_3.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n<h3>Deep Customization</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/specificites.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Brand-new custom recipes</strong> - Designed especially for Farmer's Delight!</li>\n<li><strong>Multidimensional exploration</strong> - Strange, beautiful, and even bizarre dimensions await discovery.</li>\n<li><strong>Custom item system</strong> - Includes dozens of custom items with <strong>beautiful textures</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Nearly complete Create ecosystem</strong> - Includes a full set of Create expansion mods.</li>\n<li><strong>Stunning world generation</strong> - Impressive terrain and structures.</li>\n<li><strong>Village and building overhaul</strong> - Comprehensive improvements to villages, buildings, and portals.</li>\n<li><strong>Built-in shaders and resource packs</strong> - Visual enhancements ready to use out of the box.</li>\n<li><strong>500+ detailed quests</strong> - Step-by-step guidance throughout the game progression.</li>\n<li><strong>150+ high-quality mods</strong> - Carefully selected gameplay expansions.</li>\n</ol><p>熟悉Create相關模組的玩家可能會很快上手，但請注意，這是一個<strong>深度客製化</strong>的整合包，使用了<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">KubeJS</a>。它不僅改變了<strong>5000+</strong>個配方，還加入了大量<strong>原創</strong>材料，同時許多現有機制也經過了<strong>大幅修改</strong>。你熟悉的玩法可能需要重新調整。不要過於依賴舊習慣——擁抱新的挑戰吧！</p>\n<h2>入門指南</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/recommendation.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n<h3>系統需求</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>最低記憶體：</strong><em>5G</em></li>\n<li><strong>推薦記憶體：</strong><em>6G-8G</em><br>\n本整合包已進行深度優化，以確保流暢的遊戲體驗，性能提升將持續進行。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>安裝方法</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Beta版本安裝：<ul>\n<li>直接從GitHub下載本整合包的Release壓縮檔。你也可以加入群組或使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpan.quark.cn%252fs%252f5100fa468f4b%2523%252flist%252fshare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">雲端硬碟連結</a>獲取。</li>\n<li>使用支援CurseForge整合包格式的啟動器（如HMCL）來安裝檔案。</li>\n<li><strong>啟動遊戲</strong></li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>未來計畫</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/future_prospects.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>持續修復錯誤</li>\n<li>增加更多華麗且強大的Tetra武器</li>\n<li>增加更多探索內容與Boss挑戰</li>\n<li>實現更真實的食物生產流程</li>\n<li>建立平衡的經濟系統</li>\n<li>設計自動化量產挑戰任務</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>社群支援</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fqm.qq.com%252fq%252fajPFnOx65a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/qq.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>加入中文社群討論！</li>\n<li>隨時歡迎向我們發送反饋意見！</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>支持我們</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.com%252fa%252fhk11238981\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/donation.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\"></a></p>\n<p>你的支持是我們繼續開發這個項目的動力！無論金額多少，每筆捐款都能幫助我們：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>保持項目運行</li>\n<li>不斷提升整合包的品質</li>\n<li>開發更多精彩的內容<br>\n感謝你的慷慨捐贈！</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>開發團隊</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/blob/main/kubejs/assets/createdelight/textures/images_for_readme/coworker.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Contributor\"></p>\n<p><strong>特別感謝所有參與此項目的成員，以下名單不分先後。</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake/graphs/contributors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://contrib.rocks/image?repo=Jasons-impart/Create-Delight-Remake\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>其他成員</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成員</th>\n<th>貢獻</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>ikoi03</td>\n<td><strong><em>畫師</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Maruyama_Ayaa</td>\n<td><strong><em>任務書撰寫</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>XinJinIris</td>\n<td><strong><em>任務書撰寫</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>史萊姆li</td>\n<td><strong><em>提供管道開口與批量外殼的程式碼</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Qi-Month</td>\n<td><strong><em>提供開發者模式程式碼</em></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>還有許多幫助過我們的朋友！</td>\n<td>……</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2>特別鳴謝</h2>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><em>從大一新生到已工作的成員，每位隊員都從繁忙的學業和工作中抽出時間參與此項目。感謝大家的支持與貢獻！</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<div>[回到頂部](#中文--english)</div>",
